## 🔥 @Transactional (Very Tricky)

**Q11:** Why @Transactional not working on private method?
**A:** Spring proxies intercept only public methods.

**Q12:** Why @Transactional fails on internal method calls?
**A:** Self-invocation bypasses proxy.

**Q13:** Difference between REQUIRED and REQUIRES_NEW?
**A:** REQUIRED joins existing transaction; REQUIRES_NEW creates a new one.

**Q14:** When to use REQUIRES_NEW?
**A:** Audit logs or failure isolation.

**Q15:** Why @Transactional should be at service layer?
**A:** Business boundary and proper proxy usage.

